<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17085" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀτί̄μ-ητος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>unhonoured, despised,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς εἴ τιν᾽ ἀτίμητον μετανάστην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					9.648
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἀ.</span> not <i>unrewarded,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Hier.</u>
				9.10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῑμή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			) <i>not valued</i> or <i>estimated,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Is.
				3.35
			</span></i>: esp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκη ἀ.</span> a cause
				<i>in which the penalty is not assessed in court,</i> but
			fixed by law beforehand, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.90
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.210
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τιμητός</span> (where the
			penalty is settled in court), <i><span class="en">
				D.
				27.67
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				8.54
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Harp.
			</span></i> s.v.; <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i> erroneously reverses this explanation. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>invaluable, priceless,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				7.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				781.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>not assessed,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				5(1).1433.45
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Messene</span>); <i>notcapable of being
				valued,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγαλμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
					805
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
